 use its shortcut to deploy it. Play immediately or wait for the right moment.","Tutorial.CodingIndustry":"This is one of the samples marked for recovery: the coding industry, shaped by extreme specialization, sustained overload, and the lingering fixation on process and responsibility. Break its defenses.","Tutorial.EnemyAttack":"Cognitive echoes detected. Hostiles are closing on the stronghold. Intercept them and do not let the stronghold fall.","Tutorial.EnemyWarning":"적군이 동쪽에서 공격을 시작합니다. 그곳은 이전까지 암흑 지대에 가려져 미리 시야를 확보할 수 없었습니다. 준비를 갖추고 아군 기지를 지키십시오.","Tutorial.FirstDefenseComplete":"Good work. The attackers are gone. Build the essential facilities next and establish a permanent foothold.","Tutorial.FreePlay":"Core upgrades provide additional bandwidth so you can control more units at once. Other building upgrades are now unlocked. Continue independently and raise the Research Center to level 3.","Tutorial.GoFriendlyStronghold":"Proceed to our local stronghold. It will be your foothold for this operation and the first line you must defend.","Tutorial.GoInvade":"The first defenses are ready. Head to the enemy stronghold to the east, break its defenses, and capture it for sample recovery.","Tutorial.MercenaryBackground":"These are general-faction structures. Their predecessors were neutral mercenaries who worked for whoever paid them. Military buildings train units that become cards; defensive buildings protect their stronghold directly.","Tutorial.Movement":"Use <color=yellow>W/A/S/D</color> to move. The minimap in the upper-right shows your position, explored ground, and objectives. Follow the objective marker.","Tutorial.Occupied":"Good. We have captured a stronghold. It expands our control and provides a valuable base for production, research, and deployment.","Tutorial.ProductionResearch":"Capturing a core building unlocks construction rights for the rest of that faction. Production buildings generate orange marrow, while research buildings develop industry technology. Build one of each and complete one research project.","Tutorial.ResearchControls":"Switch industries in the construction list to inspect their buildings. At a research building, change to the research tab and hold an option or its shortcut to develop a technology.","Tutorial.Speaker.Director":"Director","Tutorial.Speaker.Narrator":"Tips","Tutorial.Speaker.Terminal":"Terminal","Tutorial.SwitchToBuild":"Hold the phase button or the <color=yellow>SwitchPhase</color> shortcut for 1.5 seconds to enter the preparation phase, where buildings can be planned and constructed.","Tutorial.SwitchToDefend":"Hold the phase button or the <color=yellow>SwitchPhase</color> shortcut for 1.5 seconds to enter the defense phase and meet the incoming attack.","Tutorial.SwitchToDevelopment":"Enter the preparation phase and establish production and research facilities in the captured stronghold.","Tutorial.SwitchToInvade":"Hold the phase button or the <color=yellow>SwitchPhase</color> shortcut for 1.5 seconds to enter the assault phase. Enemy strongholds can only be captured during an assault.","Tutorial.UpgradeControls":"Approach the core building and open its upgrade panel. Change tabs to inspect upgrade paths, then hold an option or its shortcut to complete the upgrade.","Tutorial.UpgradeMission":"To recover this sample completely, upgrade the coding core building to level 3. Go to the captured Research Center and begin upgrading it.","Tutorial.WorldMap":"Open the world map to inspect the region, stronghold control, and objectives. During preparation, you can use it to travel between any friendly strongholds.","UNLOCK":"잠금 해제","Unit_Desc_BoneButcher":"","Unit_Desc_Brat":"","Unit_Desc_CanMaker":"","Unit_Desc_ColdCarrier":"","Unit_Desc_Courier":"","Unit_Desc_Firefighter":"","Unit_Desc_Gardener":"","Unit_Desc_GateGuard":"","Unit_Desc_Harvester":"","Unit_Desc_Hero":"","Unit_Desc_HiredBodyguard":"","Unit_Desc_HydroGunner":"","Unit_Desc_Intern":"","Unit_Desc_JavelinThrower":"","Unit_D